Third-party data attribution
----------------------------
Australian locality/coordinate data used by the extension is derived from the
GeoNames Australian postal code export:
https://www.geonames.org/
https://download.geonames.org/export/zip/AU.zip

GeoNames data is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The data was transformed for this extension by removing postal facilities,
collapsing locations to one coordinate per name and state, and omitting
ambiguous names with points more than 15 km apart in the same state.
The GeoNames-derived data remains subject to CC BY 4.0, not Apache-2.0.
See extension/src/data/au-places.js and tools/build-places.mjs.

